  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Gig Poster",
    "overview": "A small-run gig poster becomes a usable music-request instrument. Mustard stock, petrol ink, condensed display type and engraved illustrations carry the personality; literal controls and readable status carry the work. The voice is a begrudgingly helpful record-store clerk: precise condescension without cruelty or obstruction.",
